# ============================================
# Markdown Documentation (Except Manuals)
# ============================================
# Tracked Markdown: README files, the manuals, docs/api, docs/tools and documents that describe the app (the owner, 2026-11-17).
# tasks/ records and IMPLEMENTATION_PROGRESS.md are local and never committed.
*.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
# The memory invariant fixtures' format description.
!crates/openalpaca_storage/tests/fixtures/memory/README.md
!docs/CLI_Manual.md
!docs/GUI_Manual.md
!docs/Daemon_Manual.md
!docs/Installation_Manual.md
!docs/QuickStart_Manual.md
!docs/Skill_Template_Reference.md
!docs/agent-loop.md
!docs/tools/*.md
!scripts/eval/steer_routing/README.md
!scripts/eval/memory/README.md
!scripts/eval/memory/judge-prompt.md
!scripts/eval/memory/coverage-judge-prompt.md
!docs/api/*
!docs/api/apps/*.md
!docs/api/crates/*.md
!docs/api/database/*.md
tasks/storage-design/maps/
tasks/storage-design/panel/
tasks/storage-design/plan-drafts/
# E6's corpus (P30; A-07 (2)): the SKILL.md edge-case fixtures beside its comparators.
tasks/**/README.md
!tasks/deps-upgrade/tools/e6/corpus/*/SKILL.md
!tasks/deps-upgrade/tools/*/README.md
# The earlier builds' shipped templates and skill files, as committed (subagent design §9).
!crates/openalpaca_core/src/bundled/fixtures/**/*.md
tasks/deps-upgrade/*.tar.gz
!config/agents/*.md
!config/orchestrator/templates/
!config/orchestrator/templates/*.md
!config/skills/*.md
!config/skills/*/*.md
!config/skills/*/*/*.md
# ============================================
# Agent
# ============================================
# The directory's files are ignored one by one (not the directory itself) so
# that the tracked, project-wide settings.json can be re-included below.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
config/.master_key
config/llm.toml
config/llm.toml.lock





# ============================================
# Embedding Model
# ============================================
.fastembed_cache

# UI rework reference docs (whitelisted from the *.md blanket ignore)
!apps/openalpaca-gui/DESIGN_SPEC.md
!apps/openalpaca-gui/API_MAP.md
